1
00:00:00,343 --> 00:00:02,013
(Leonard:)You left with his date.

2
00:00:02,179 --> 00:00:03,849
(Leonard:)Friends don't do that to each other.

3
00:00:04,598 --> 00:00:06,138
(Dr Koothrappali:)Oh.

4
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:08,063
All right, noted.

5
00:00:09,936 --> 00:00:12,856
(Sheldon(on phone):)- Sorry.
- "Sorry"? That's all you can say is "sorry"?

6
00:00:13,023 --> 00:00:15,233
(Leonard:)Take it, Raj.
It's more than I've ever gotten.

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,440
(Sheldon:)And may I point out...

8
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:19,740
(Sheldon:)...she wouldn't have asked me to go
if you weren't drunk and boring.

9
00:00:19,946 --> 00:00:23,116
(Dr Koothrappali:)- Drunk?
- And boring. Her words.

10
00:00:23,283 --> 00:00:26,033
(Dr Koothrappali:)I knew it, he moves to America
and becomes an alcoholic.

11
00:00:26,203 --> 00:00:27,833
(Raj:)I'm not an alcoholic.

12
00:00:27,996 --> 00:00:29,666
(Dr Koothrappali:)Then why were you drunk?

13
00:00:29,831 --> 00:00:31,711
(Raj:)It was just this one time, Papa, I swear.

14
00:00:31,875 --> 00:00:34,965
(Dr Koothrappali:)Are you in denial? Do we have
to come over and do an intervention?

15
00:00:35,128 --> 00:00:37,548
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Don't embarrass him
in front of his friends.

16
00:00:37,714 --> 00:00:39,504
All right. Carry us outside.

17
00:00:39,674 --> 00:00:41,884
(Dr Koothrappali:)We want to talk to you in private.

18
00:00:42,385 --> 00:00:44,055
- But, Papa, please...
- Now, Rajesh.

19
00:00:48,517 --> 00:00:49,937
(Raj(to Leonard and Sheldon):)I have to go.

20
00:00:52,187 --> 00:00:55,357
DR. KOOTHRAPPALI: Now, listen to me...
- At least wait till I get into the hall.

21
00:00:57,192 --> 00:00:58,482
[DOOR CLOSES]

22
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,020
(Sheldon:)Okay, well, good night.

